    <help sid="HelpWatercraftEquipment_BilgePumpCode_A">
      <value>Enter Y for a &#x201C;Yes&#x201D; response. Input N for &#x201C;No&#x201D; response.  Indicate if the watercraft has a bilge pump.  A bilge pump is a manually operated or automatically activated device used for pumping water from the inner part of the ship's hull.  Using the same principle as the manual pump, the automatic pump is activated by the rise of water within the hull.  Specify the manufacturer and the model (e.g., Dynaflow Pump 304) in the space provided. </value>
    </help>
